## 6. LLM Provider Abstraction

**Three-backend dispatcher in [backends/llm.py](vvaharness/backends/llm.py):**

```python
def resolve(model_cfg: Any) -> tuple[str, str, dict]:
    # Returns (model_id, backend, extras: {temperature, thinking_budget, betas})
    # Accepts: bare string "claude-opus-4-7" → ("claude-opus-4-7", "cli", {})
    #          or Config object with .id, .via, .temperature, etc.

_BACKENDS = {"cli": cli, "sdk": sdk, "openai": oai}

def prompt(user_prompt: str, *, model: Any, **kw) -> str:
    model_id, via, extras = resolve(model)
    backend = _BACKENDS.get(via)
    return backend.prompt(user_prompt, model=model_id, **kw)

def agentic(user_prompt: str, *, model: Any, **kw) -> str:
    # Tool-using loop
    return backend.agentic(user_prompt, model=model_id, **kw)
```

**Supported providers:**

| Provider | Backend | Auth | Stage Usage | Capabilities |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| **Anthropic Claude** (all models) | `via: cli` | Claude Code OAuth token (`CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN`) | S1–S9 | Read, Glob, Grep, Bash (only backend with Bash) |
| **Anthropic Claude** (via SDK) | `via: sdk` | `ANTHROPIC_SDK_API_KEY` | S1–S9 | Read, Glob, Grep (no Bash); streaming; temperature control; prompt caching |
| **OpenAI** (gpt-4o, o1, etc.) | `via: openai` | `OPENAI_API_KEY` | S1–S9 (S10/S11 unsupported; raises NotImplementedError on file-mutation tools) | Read, Glob, Grep (local tool loop); no Bash; rejects `temperature` on reasoning models |
| **Anthropic/OpenAI** (via DeepAgents) | `via: deepagents` | `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` or `OPENAI_API_KEY` | S10 (remediate), S11 (validate) | Read/Edit/Write/Bash in mutating roles (cwd-confined); permission sandbox |

