No explicit few-shot examples in system prompts. S6 verifier does have embedded examples of VERDICT format: `VERDICT: TRUE_POSITIVE (confidence: 9/10) — ...` ([s6_verify.py](vvaharness/pipeline/stages/s6_verify.py#L100-L150))

